    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "一九六六年八月，巴西山顶亮起一道红光。",
      "sha256": "c26ece2f309203d5eed85c2d547888f3e7f90d71297ad10d87871e2f802e63f6",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "两个男人戴着铅面具，并排躺在山顶的草丛里，纹丝不动。",
      "sha256": "c204fc0a663ee47bffe934740e613bc30358beffe15367e0ce7158ba4fb8b949",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "他们叫米格尔和曼努埃尔，在坎普斯市修电视和收音机。",
      "sha256": "2d25ed0d6e135372de541a790be5c605440b9377c669c3c230e706a521421678",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "两个人靠给电视台装天线、修收音机吃饭，也上门修电器。",
      "sha256": "281b79ff4fb69cb4e8af4427f5f3b9f3b12298f58345c38a2c533e5716bebe06",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "八月十七号，他们对妻子说，去圣保罗买车和仪器。",
      "sha256": "f219692bdabc4e491cfcd5246079434b6cfda993595f36cbdcf35fa668353e13",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "可当天下午，他们却出现在一百公里外的尼泰罗伊车站。",
      "sha256": "83a3ec3a00f649ffcf4c61f280d79d357d013605244a96b51394e6674a52fd9c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "尼泰罗伊郊外有座荒山，叫文廷山，山顶光秃秃的，没有路灯。",
      "sha256": "e27a02c666c613556a0bc2014ff01d3825b104974f3bbced8ec2e6fb626cdaf3",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "八月二十号下午，一个十八岁的少年抱着风筝，一个人沿着小路走上山顶。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "他刚站上山顶，就看见草丛里并排躺着两个男人，一动不动。",
      "sha256": "421b2a91b8351307612cee271f45368d2113a806c6fdca8f333d8dc0ad787db7",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "他僵在原地，手里的风筝线滑落，风筝飘向天空。",
      "sha256": "e339802da49ba5da224b2fc6b1df39e086073a18d089b27ddca33a3cfa020328",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "警方封锁了现场，草地上没有血迹，只有两处浅浅的人形压痕。",
      "sha256": "31f31cb0f3a2aa93d3719a503b6b65f8f795b25c95ee2a0d678e58a9627b945e",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他们穿着西装，外面套着雨衣，身边只有一只空水瓶。",
      "sha256": "3a8c71bd3b10eaedb9797b8bcb55757e13ba00d46575d29aae856c132d0aefdf",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "铅灰色的眼罩，映着最后一点红光。",
