      "target_duration": 8,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "警局里，几名探员围着地图争论了一整夜：究竟是谁，把他们叫上那座山？",
      "sha256": "1c46116e0540b999e16e5348be55d6ffbaab72f480241924a027bd8e0319c46c",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "医生摘下眼镜：没有枪伤，没有刀伤，也没有任何打斗的痕迹。",
      "sha256": "3d0e3d14e133758d8be6dbfa4cd7e3a8279486f6b76b41eb4d4f80ad089edf2b",
