      "target_start": 105,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "有渔民说，那晚山顶上空有过一团红橙色的光，还带着低低的嗡鸣。",
      "sha256": "806993fbca8c47bbbddcdcdf057f6b6ccf6088771a27b76b039d0b4b15d60879",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "第一种说法：他们是来找外星人的，那铅面具就是为了挡住强光。",
      "sha256": "089abc79a0e848140bad58dbb929f6c46ce339c8d95ea357c9394bfcac6bdb85",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 117,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "两位技师痴迷实验和神秘学，桌上堆满图纸、线圈和旧书。",
      "sha256": "f02fefadd96f496ba8f967c9440e8ec6994e1be970a66d567d613bda22fcf584",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 124,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "他们在等天上一个信号——可这，只是传闻罢了。",
      "sha256": "476d471e87c14054711713eb5cca1724b872ead43a529646b4d9609d4635b6df",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N06",
