      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "第二种说法：某个神秘团体用药物做实验，他们乖乖吞下了胶囊。",
      "sha256": "4ead0e60155573b6b12ebf0da5819f717716cc98a5de725b53d6859478f1c3ff",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "第三种说法：有人利用他们对飞碟的痴迷，一步步把他们骗上山。",
      "sha256": "05b4625360bdac0798f40d431d5d2deddc72aca05c3646f7212f898895e87afd",
      "voice_id": "voice-01",
      "voice_description": "用户重选的低沉悬疑男声；叙事沉稳、气压低、句尾收得很轻",
      "narration_id": "N07",
